e sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nFirst, we rewrite the sequence in the form ${a}_{n}=a\\cdot {r}^{n},$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{n} & =\\frac{8\\cdot {11}^{n}}{{9}^{n}} \\\\  & =8\\cdot \\frac{{11}^{n}}{{9}^{n}} \\\\  & =8{(\\frac{11}{9})}^{n}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now see that this is the geometric sequence with $r=\\frac{11}{9}.$ \n\nSince $|r|>1,$ the sequence diverges." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-141314/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c023b634-e106-5fbc-a8ff-197f3aa4869d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-141314"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-49565/selection/4700b63e35c02b94ebd9de7e75bc95939b0398afb11476be7ea739375bf68d3e" :answer/id #uuid "1e5c1fcb-334e-59c9-83fe-39d8bd325b25" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{2}{5}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49565/selection/1fe42682da7de1440c4b43b0a6ab83822378d12767db8083df4ada8e3bf47b13" :answer/id #uuid "0cb036f9-b547-5f88-9c5f-5fe5d5153cd9" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $3$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49565/selection/f5ba9cb7e3373c690e498bc176135d7b1a2093e80dfdec0ef9d7cefcc7228be5" :answer/id #uuid "670faddf-4300-5f7b-a824-5358783739dd" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "The sequence diverges" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49565/selection/2138db08dd77fb6a6208df7695e1306e5c475172434285aae5afd56c0602e3a0" :answer/id #uuid "860e055d-1c4d-5143-8de0-185ecb97e696" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $\\frac{2}{25}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-49565/selection/04807305688d046c901dfe9206d434cec6318beb3adc535ab23fa5189b949df5" :answer/id #uuid "f3821cdf-ab7e-55b8-ba3f-f685ca40455c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "Converges to $0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "