ion.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-351612/field-1" "q-351612/field-2" "q-351612/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "126485fb-1b7f-5602-bc8d-05908ac6f37c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-351612"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-141332/selection/18a82edba82532c9879ee81d6f976e6f127cf5c01b13c5bd24e7336124576623" :answer/id #uuid "e290f5ea-6bef-5cdd-bccc-9e5d6b8ca35f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0<x\\le \\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141332/selection/eb974af25f7cad614022cdd558a4e8472f5e3e606b024c17f3db85b309d0ab74" :answer/id #uuid "00d2b546-079e-5e0a-94b3-755fed682f11" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0<x\\le 1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141332/selection/defefa94e8bccd9a3972a17f2979ec863adea25b8af9520359425f0ea8ea33cf" :answer/id #uuid "9755169a-295f-55b1-bb44-4ced86139c5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge \\sqrt{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141332/selection/ebe6f4d26afa362a416b64d63b5c4b51d9e2ae71005bcb2b10a9632f19911f50" :answer/id #uuid "1f8e6cca-26fe-5dd6-ab39-6ba2243b5dea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge 2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141332/selection/3cfc233d457edbec6b6deb35df070179afd90e6508c5585cd03e094cf600a715" :answer/id #uuid "8e531f7b-f637-550b-922a-4b3dab14981c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge 1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141332/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "170c7709-3aca-5d51-a523-b62ef8ff639f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-141332/selection/defefa94e8bccd9a3972a17f2979ec863adea25b8af9520359425f0ea8ea33cf" :answer-field/choices ["q-141332/selection/18a82edba82532c9879ee81d6f976e6f127cf5c01b13c5bd24e7336124576623" "q-141332/selection/eb974af25f7cad614022cdd558a4e8472f5e3e606b024c17f3db85b309d0ab74" "q-141332/selection/defefa94e8bccd9a3972a17f2979ec863adea25b8af9520359425f0ea8ea33cf" "q-141332/selection/ebe6f4d26afa362a416b64d63b5c4b51d9e2ae71005bcb2b10a9632f19911f50" "q-141332/selection/3cfc233d457edbec6b6deb35df070179afd90e6508c5585cd03e094cf600a715"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-141332" :question/id #uuid "8be74ccf-bbd3-56f1-a2ff-c77c6c122f36" :question/math-academy-id "q-141332" :question/problem "Consider the geometric sequence ${a}_{n}=\\frac{x}{2}{(\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}})}^{n},$ where $x$ is a positive real number and $n\\ge 1.$ What are the values of $x$ for which the sequence converges?" :question/worked-solution "Suppose we have a geometric sequence with the first term ${a}_{1}$ and common ratio $r.$ Then, we have the following convergence properties:\n\n- if $|r|<1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to $0$\n\n- if $|r|>1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nMoreover, we have the following edge cases:\n\n- if $r=1,$ the sequence is convergent and converges to ${a}_{1}$\n\n- if $r=-1,$ the sequence is divergent\n\nThe given sequence is a geometric sequence with the common ratio $r=\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}.$ \nSince ${x}^{2}$ is positive,  $r$ is also positive, So, the convergence condition is $0<r\\le 1.$ \n\nTherefore, the  sequence converges for \n\n$$\n0<\\frac{2}{{x}^{2}}\\le 1\\,⟹\\,{x}^{2}\\ge 2.\n$$\n\n \n\nTaking into account the fact that $x$ is positive, we get\n\n$$\nx\\ge \\sqrt{2}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-141332/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "126485fb-1b7f-5602-bc8d-05908ac6f37c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-141332"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-141318/selection/143e8067d99e10346ddd8e30f47607c441325e4495f95ed75f9f66e68cd73349" :answer/id #uuid "0210bad6-e105-5720-9621-9b1a5ad59ea2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x\\ge \\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-141318/selection/3cfc233d457edbec6b6deb35d